    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n15059" root="رحل" body-key="r">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَحَّالٌ</span></b>  <i>Skilled in the saddling of camels.</i> (K.)
― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  Also A man <i>who removes,</i> or <i>journeys,</i> or
<i>travels, much;</i> and so ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَحَّالَةٌ</span></b> , [or rather this
signifies one <i>who removes,</i> or <i>journeys,</i> or <i>travels,
very much,</i>] and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَحُولٌ</span></b> : and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رُحَّلٌ</span></b>  [pl. of
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَاحِلٌ</span>, q. v.,] persons <i>who remove,</i> or <i>journey,</i> or
<i>travel, much.</i> (TA.)

